 ## Project Purpose

 The purpose of this project is to demonstrate how raw sales information can be converted into an interactive dashboard that supports business analysis. Instead of reviewing individual records manually, users can quickly identify sales trends, compare products, analyze salesperson performance, and explore regional results through visualizations.

 ## Conclusion

 The **Sales Performance Dashboard – 2014** provides a centralized view of sales performance and enables users to explore the data through multiple analytical dimensions. The dashboard highlights an overall sales value of **18,307**, strong contributions from **Beer and Fruit Cocktail**, and noticeable variation in monthly sales throughout the year.

 This project demonstrates the practical application of dashboard-based analytics for converting sales data into clear, actionable business insights.
